	"youkaishomecoming.subtitle.deer_death": "鹿死亡",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.title": "符卡编辑器帮助",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.survival.0": "\u00A7e\u00A7l--- 在生存模式创建符卡 ---",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.survival.1": "\u00A77右键空符卡进入创建页，填写符卡 ID 后按 Enter 或点击创建。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.survival.2": "\u00A77省略命名空间时，会自动使用你的玩家名作为命名空间。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.survival.3": "\u00A77在“符卡初始化”节点设置血量、展示名及展示节点衔接。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.survival.4": "\u00A77“变量”页显示节点用量、能力等级和性能预算。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.survival.5": "\u00A77[EXP] 功能需要符卡基底授权；Hook 会增加执行量。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.survival.6": "\u00A77[OP] 仅管理员可用；认证前请先处理所有红色提示。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.survival.7": "\u00A77用“保存并刷新”保存改动；认证完成后再发放正式符卡。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.survival.8": "",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.0": "\u00A7e\u00A7l--- 基本信息 ---",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.1": "\u00A77符卡由阶段、动作节点和可选的命中/到期回调组成。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.2": "\u00A77所有时间使用 tick，距离使用方块；认证以服务端分析结果为准。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.3": "\u00A77节点右侧的颜色标签表示普通、EXP 或 OP 能力等级。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.4": "",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.5": "\u00A7e\u00A7l--- 快捷键 ---",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.6": "\u00A7fSpace       \u00A77播放/暂停预览",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.7": "\u00A7fRight       \u00A77单步推进 1 tick",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.8": "\u00A7fR           \u00A77重置预览到 tick 0",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.9": "\u00A7fCtrl+Z/Y    \u00A77撤销/重做",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.10": "\u00A7fCtrl+C/X/V  \u00A77复制/剪切/粘贴节点",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.11": "\u00A7fCtrl+D      \u00A77启用/禁用节点",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.12": "\u00A7fCtrl+E      \u00A77折叠/展开选中子树",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.13": "\u00A7fDel/Bksp    \u00A77删除选中节点",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.14": "",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.15": "\u00A7e\u00A7l--- 节点树与属性 ---",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.16": "\u00A7f  单击节点    \u00A77选中并在属性面板编辑",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.17": "\u00A7f  点击 \u25BC/\u25B6   \u00A77折叠/展开分支",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.18": "\u00A7f  拖拽节点    \u00A77重排或移入分支",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.19": "\u00A7f  点击 [+]    \u00A77在当前段落/分支添加节点",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.20": "\u00A7f  [Disable]/[Delete]  \u00A77跳过/删除节点",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.21": "\u00A7f  Tab         \u00A77表达式补全；Ctrl+点击 $var 跳转定义",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.22": "\u00A7f  滚轮        \u00A77滚动属性面板或拖动滚动条",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.23": "",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.24": "\u00A7e\u00A7l--- Viewport ---",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.25": "\u00A7f  正交 LMB     \u00A77选中弹幕/拖动施法者、目标或方块目标",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.26": "\u00A7f  MMB/RMB      \u00A77平移/旋转视角；滚轮缩放",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.27": "\u00A7f  Edit Origin  \u00A77暂停后在选中弹幕旁移动原点",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.28": "\u00A7f  Apply/Cancel \u00A77提交或撤销原点拖动",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.29": "\u00A7f  Rotate Group \u00A77绕 X/Y/Z 旋转选中弹幕组",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.30": "\u00A7f  Persp        \u00A77进入透视视角；WASD/空格/Shift 移动",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.31": "\u00A7f  BindTgt      \u00A77让目标跟随透视摄像机位置和视线",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.32": "",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.33": "\u00A7e\u00A7l--- 顶栏与面板 ---",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.34": "\u00A7f  卡面拍摄     \u00A77独立拍摄符卡材质；认证前也可使用",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.35": "\u00A7f  保存并刷新   \u00A77保存编辑并刷新使用该符卡的实体",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.36": "\u00A7f  认证并导出   \u00A77通过认证后发放正式符卡；Raw JSON 可手动复制",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.37": "\u00A7f  ▶All/▼All    \u00A77全部折叠/展开；[+]:Sel/All 切换添加按钮范围",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.38": "\u00A7f  面板标签     \u00A77可拖动停靠、拆分或切换活动面板",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.39": "",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.40": "\u00A7e\u00A7l--- 表达式与认证 ---",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.41": "\u00A77数值框支持 + - * / %、括号、$变量和函数（如 rand、lerp、sin_deg）。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.42": "\u00A77回调表达式可读取 source_speed、source_hook_x/y/z、hit_x/y/z 等快照值。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.43": "\u00A77表达式红线表示无法解析；修正后再保存或认证。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.44": "\u00A77认证会检查初始化节点、能力等级和性能预算；失败原因显示在提示中。",
	"youkaishomecoming.spell_editor.help.line.45": "",
